            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3029",
            "content": {
                "en": "Uh, I don’t recognize it either, but it should be somewhere near the Qiqiao Festival venue.",
                "zh": "呃，我也不认得，但应该是在乞巧大会会场附近吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1026.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b67e4d5b-dc7e-4f66-abb0-f86de173ef9e",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3030",
            "content": {
                "en": "Um… my head was a mess just now. Thanks for telling me about what was happening on the plane.",
                "zh": "那个......刚才我脑子有点乱，谢谢你告诉我飞机上的事。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1356.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "04444b97-6862-424d-87dd-3c2b5cbb1081",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3031",
            "content": {
                "en": "Same here. Thank you for getting me out of there.",
                "zh": "我也是，谢谢你带我离开那里。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1684.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "92f70190-ec84-4e71-b7e7-e26febced394",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3032",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah, but I can’t just abandon the people on that plane. Let’s part ways here.",
                "zh": "嗯，但我不能放着飞机上的人不管，我们就在这里分别吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2012.0,
            "positionY": 722.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e4c77733-3522-4c4b-be96-c354f55bf227",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3033",
            "content": {
                "en": "You’re going back to that plane?",
                "zh": "你还要回那架飞机上去？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2350.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c46b7c43-cb6e-483a-a049-e9d72dd33cd8",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3034",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ll return to the temple first and see if I can bring back reinforcements, but I definitely can’t just leave those people to die.",
                "zh": "我会先回道观看看能不能搬到救兵，但总归不能放着那些人等死。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2676.0,
            "positionY": 724.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "875f1a67-7152-4d2d-bb7f-063d5ca4a1b1",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3035",
            "content": {
                "en": "......",
                "zh": "......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3030.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_3036",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then take care. I’ll go now.",
                        "zh": "那你保重，我先走了。",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                },
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_3037",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Maybe I can help.",
                        "zh": "或许我能帮上忙。",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                }
            ],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
