            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3047",
            "content": {
                "en": "I gathered some information in the first two loops. Isn’t this near the Yuntai Fair?",
                "zh": "我通过前两个循环收集了一些信息，这里不是芸台大会附近吗？",
