            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3048",
            "content": {
                "en": "Maybe I can ask around here, see if I can find a way to break this situation.",
                "zh": "或许我可以在这里打听一下，看看能不能找到破局的方法。",
